  {
    "id": "irregular-verbs",
    "title": "不规则动词",
    "en": "Irregular Verbs",
    "summary": "按变化规律分五类，共 120 个高频不规则动词。每条给出原形、释义，note 里是「过去式 / 过去分词」。",
    "sortOrder": 4,
    "related": [
      {
        "topic": "tenses",
        "category": "word",
        "title": "时态",
        "reason": "一般过去时用第二列（过去式），现在完成时和过去完成时用第三列（过去分词）：went、gone。"
      },
      {
        "topic": "passive",
        "category": "word",
        "title": "被动语态",
        "reason": "被动语态是 be + 过去分词，表里第三列就是它：The window was broken. / The work has been done."
      },
      {
        "topic": "nonfinite",
        "category": "word",
        "title": "非谓语动词",
        "reason": "过去分词可以作定语、状语和完成式：a broken window、Having finished the work, he left."
      },
      {
        "topic": "subjunctive",
        "category": "syntax",
        "title": "虚拟语气",
        "reason": "与过去事实相反要用 had + 过去分词，第三列直接套：If I had known, I would have told you."
      },
      {
        "topic": "verbs",
        "category": "word",
        "title": "动词基础",
